# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules. Parsed by Pages at deploy time (it is never
# served as a static asset itself) and applied before the SPA fallback, so a
# path listed here redirects instead of loading the game's index.html.
#
# /play — short link for pushing players straight to the Android app instead of
# routing them through the website first. Keep the URL in sync with
# PLAY_STORE_URL in src/systems/UpdateGate.ts (appId com.hanlinsoftware.heapgame.app).
# 302 (not 301) so the destination stays changeable without browsers having
# cached the old target forever.
/play  https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.hanlinsoftware.heapgame.app  302
/play/ https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.hanlinsoftware.heapgame.app  302
